{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_04_beg","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_04","title":"熱灼夢","storyCode":"FC-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"59571c89457a95c565b5d85340cd8d9073498fd98dfaed5e1f8a19c1dac0737e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我看到前面有人！有軍隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"在那個方向......呃，七、七點鐘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒關係，我們差不多聽懂啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你確定沒看錯嗎？這一帶明明是完全沒有人煙的荒野呀......怎麼會有軍隊巡邏到這種地方來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"望遠鏡給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近能夠藏身的地形很少，請大家先在這裡躲一躲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你一起去。要說維多利亞的軍隊，我比你熟吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙，幫我看一眼......我蹲在這塊岩石下面，應該哪個角度過來的敵人都看不見我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，還行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。天啊，我們都平安無事地在荒野裡走了四天了，既沒天災也沒猛獸......最後這一段路要是出了事，那也太倒楣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也別探頭探腦的了，快來一起蹲著。都這麼久了，你還信不過葦草她們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我最不信任的就是她那種老好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就想做那些誰都不得罪的事，這樣要是事情出了錯，也一定不是她自己的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你呀，說到底就是不喜歡她阻攔我們去深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧，但我對你就沒什麼意見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經確認了，是一支維多利亞小型部隊，但從裝備來看，不是附近的駐軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的武器十分精良，如果交戰......我們取勝的機率很小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許他們不是來搜捕我們的，但是以防萬一，我們還是躲藏起來。按照目前的行進方向，他們不會看到我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我沒意見，那是因為我說話沒人聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我可不是嫉妒她搶了我的風頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那支隊伍靠近了。往那邊挪一挪，給我個好位置盯著他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，求你別在這時候惹上麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼回事？打起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有一隊人在隘道埋伏他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那要是剛剛我們沒停下來躲在這，是不是我們也要被打了？等在那裡的是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喂......我雖然看不太清，但那些人穿的衣服，是不是跟塞爾蒙你的有點像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是......深池吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八個月前的一個凌晨，我剛剛結束工作，正在半島郡的一家餐廳吃早餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廣播裡傳來一個聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個聲音說，他們要用火焰淨化維多利亞的污濁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要以塔拉人的名義......向維多利亞宣戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們自稱“深池”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......一群貪婪的暴徒給自己找的名號罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"符合常規認知的暴徒的那部分人，大概全都死在小丘郡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人想用一整座城市的塔拉人來試探那位塔拉出身的公爵......可他們沒有想到的是，那位深池的領袖反過來利用了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事件結束後，深池成功地肅清了內部的不安定分子，進一步博得了周邊塔拉民眾的支持，在維多利亞的眼皮子底下全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"深池領袖確實深諳貴族的行事風格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到她的出身以及背後的支持者，這不足為奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位領袖以及她的情報人員很清楚，向民眾扔髒彈的是駐軍，因此小丘郡事件的真相永遠不會被追查下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......我讀過那些報告。所有的報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人說，在那天的小丘郡現身的深池“領袖”......不止一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"這並不符合公爵收到的其他情報。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到這兩塊拼圖了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"一模一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要形狀一樣，就都能填補同一個缺口。而當它們像這樣放在一起的時候，許多人一眼望過來，都會把一塊當成另一塊的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......影子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你懷疑之前那個與深池有關的縱火案是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本就只是懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到......那個名叫阿赫茉妮的菲林的反應，給了我一些有趣的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍爾","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到，威靈頓公爵真的會放任蓋爾王的另一位後裔在荒野上自由行走呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，和您想的一樣，今天早上有人把那幾家農戶的人帶走問話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"我打探過了，他們穿的並不是駐軍的衣服，看起來並不是附近巡邏隊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你說，要是我想請個長假出去旅行的話，去哪裡比較好呢？萊塔尼亞，還是卡西米爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然跑得更遠一些......就跟我的好校友一樣，去一趟炎國吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不明白您的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，雖然一不小心中了陷阱......但還是得盡力補救一下。確保她的安全是最優先的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我親愛的朋友，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"您確定他們在找的人是她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又能確定不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有其他選擇。誰讓她也是“領袖”呢？我們可不能讓她落到其他人......尤其是開斯特公爵手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，該去找“校官”了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"塞爾蒙，我們怎麼辦？你說帶著我們去投奔深池的隊伍，現在他們就在眼前了，還跟那些當兵的打起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"於情，我們應該去給塔拉人的隊伍幫忙；於理，我們加入隊伍也需要表示一下忠心......是這麼回事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行不行，你們在說什麼呢！那些當兵的我們根本打不過啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而、而且......葦草她們心裡該怎麼想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她們躲在那邊，跟我們還有點距離，說不定看不到我們的動作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，又倒下去一個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們總不能就這麼看著塔拉人被打死吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......維恩，你回頭看一眼，葦草她們是什麼反應？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人回撤，優先擺脫追擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"調查任務已經完成，我們的時間不能浪費在這裡，深池布下的疑兵太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，三點鐘方向發現人員活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"像是普通流民，持有自製武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先展開接觸，確認虛實。所有人，做好雙向應敵準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警惕深池正規部隊偽裝成平民的可能性。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那個人怎麼從掩體背後冒頭了呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，軍隊的人發現了。他們過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去試試看跟他們交涉，告訴他們這裡全是平民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，塔拉當地的駐軍，一定不會相信平民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們從來沒有保護過我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......你、你好......我們是塔拉人，想加入深池......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——怎、怎麼回事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......儘快撤退。兩支隊伍在同時攻擊我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可深池......不是應該保護塔拉人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒辦法回答你。我只知道這些士兵已經死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"制式破城矛，瓦伊凡......你是不是前風暴突擊隊成員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我們見過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我們認識，那事情就更好辦了。我們不是什麼伏兵，跟深池也沒有關係，你誤會我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，誰能想到，菲舍爾那小子只是讓我來跟蹤一條線索，結果卻撞見了他真正要找的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，他大概就是想讓我在這裡等你們撞上來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，你為什麼要保護塔拉人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，因為這是我們的職責啊？塔拉人也是維多利亞人呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誤會解開了的話，是不是可以停手了？攻擊平民是違反軍隊紀律的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是怎麼還能說出這種話的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎還不夠清楚這裡的局勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啊，這個我還是很清楚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友說你們不會保護塔拉平民，我剛剛確認過了，她是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們和小丘郡的漢密爾頓上校是差不多的人，沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才確信，就算我退役了，我還是得履行一個維多利亞軍人的職責，做你們不願意做的事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護這些平民的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特別行動隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你打聽過你身邊那個白髮瓦伊凡的身份嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走、走呀，塞爾蒙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都在想辦法逃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這種時候你還較什麼勁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道這很難接受，可......陳說的好像是真的......所以，先走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們先活下來，再商量之後的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在看誰？那難道是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，維恩......這次的傷勢和你之前的腿傷一樣，不是很嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，還是會有些疼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這個無所謂......只要不見血，別的我都無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"膽小鬼，你還說想給塞爾蒙幫忙呢，結果還是被她扛著逃出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也、也沒什麼不好吧，至少逃出來了。我們所有人都逃出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草，我得問個問題......這半天裡我一直想問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的朋友們像是這方面的專家。可是，我還是不明白，你們為什麼說那些人......那些深池的人是死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一他們是在夢遊呢？或者是中了傳說裡那種讓人失去意識的巫術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一......萬一他們真的只是什麼夢遊症，本來我們可以把人家叫醒的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不會的。我也希望給你們一些慰藉，但是，我認識那種特殊的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧。我只是有點害怕，可塞爾蒙該怎麼想啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，說吧，維恩，我們誰都不認識她，一開始都是你擔保她可信，是個好人，我們才跟著她走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我其實是被她打劫過，才跟她認識的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，最後我們坐下來好好溝通了。她就是想要一雙結實的靴子，那個冬天她哥蹲在雪地裡，穿著鞋底掉了一半的靴子，腳都凍壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那你給了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有，她哥去深池了。我只來得及幫那隊人打個掩護，沒來得及搞到什麼結實的靴子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她這一路，其實是出來找她哥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？她帶我們加入深池就為這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也不能這麼說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她兩年前是想跟她哥一起去深池的，只是在路上逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說她今天追上她哥的時候，心裡得多難受啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎，你覺得我家裡人怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都還在村子裡住著呢，屋簷上蓋的茅草該換了。等找到個落腳的地方，我得托信使問候一下他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，他們肯定沒事的。到時候，我幫你找信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是我們要去哪裡？我們追的深池部隊是死人，塞爾蒙的目標也沒了，我們該往哪裡走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，葦草，你覺得......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......葦草？她去哪了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......十三，十四，十五......比白天少了三個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真搞不懂，這是什麼源石技藝啊，看一眼就讓人難受。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她躲在岩石後張望著。\n昏黑的荒野上，士兵們還在向著他們心中的終點行軍。\n深池的裝束在層層泥汙和塵土中褪色，他們被籠在相似的輪廓下，輪廓被不知從何而來的微光照亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只要......偷襲，然後撤退，沒問題的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一百米。\n他們正朝著塞爾蒙藏身的岩石走來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，他走在隊伍最後，看來是沒當上小隊長啊。每次信裡還寫那麼多大話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人前進的方向......還是和信裡說的一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"五十米。\n塞爾蒙握緊了手中的木棒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要去的那座城市，對你來說有那麼重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰叫你去的？就算死了也要去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣，被風吹，被雨淋，被人一次又一次打傷，也要去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三十米。\n她想起兩年前自己第一次見到深池的隊伍。\n那些人說，想好了的話，可以來找我們。領袖會給所有塔拉人生存之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......一直都做不到像你那樣堅定，像你那樣從不回頭。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她衝了出去。\n像白天的那些維多利亞士兵一樣，像陳一樣，只要每一擊夠快夠狠，這些已經死去的人也可以再次被打倒。\n直到他平靜地沉睡在塔拉的泥土裡，再也不用站起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵沒有倒下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"被擊中後頸的士兵只是踉蹌了一下，接著動作迅捷地轉過身來，抽出了劍。\n他一聲不吭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們！別攔我！要我把你們也一起送走嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也行啊，可以啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來我只是來找我哥的，但你們也一樣......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默地揮擊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——煩死了！至少說句話吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打中了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，可惜。頭部，正面，這一下不夠吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"木棒在招架攻擊時脫手飛出。\n同時，士兵的面罩掉了下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她產生了一種錯覺。她覺得對方揮舞武器的動作有一瞬間停頓。\n她覺得哥哥正要向她張開雙手，像小時候面對維多利亞巡警時那樣，把她護在懷裡。\n接著她看清了那張熟悉的面孔。\n他的額頭上沒有滲出鮮血，他的眼睛也沒有看向自己的妹妹。\n那雙眼睛正望向遙遠而模糊的地平線，渴望的火光在其中熊熊燃燒。\n——就像他決定動身去找深池的那個夜晚一樣。\n深池士兵圍了上來，塞爾蒙怔怔地向面前的男人伸出手。\n敬佩，憧憬，愧疚。遺憾。\n所有的情感都被她指尖觸摸到的那簇冰冷的火焰吞沒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恐懼。\n剩下的只有恐懼。對那至死燃燒的狂熱渴求的恐懼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"下一刻，烈焰升騰，明熾的火花開向夜空。\n在她指尖幾乎能觸及的地方，火焰的花朵綻開，又在她抓到前消散。士兵倒在地上，再也沒有聲息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
